  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "我上愛ê一塊歌"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>陳喬恩</b></span></p><p><br /></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">〈針線情〉是我上愛聽ê歌， 伊描寫翁仔某，ná親像是針kah線黏sio倚bē分開。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我mā真kah意tsit塊歌曲ê聲調，勻勻仔，細聲溫柔，koh有tsiânn深ê感情，bē輸翁仔某the tī眠床頂，寒天時，兩人sio攬做伙睏，lóng bē驚寒。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span></span></p><a name='more'></a><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tse mā hōo我想著阿爸kah阿母做伙拍拚，為著家庭付出tsiah-nī仔濟，hōo阮序細上好ê模樣——翁仔某ài互相照顧，bē-sái放sak你ê牽手。見若聽著tsit塊歌，就想起俗諺講「翁仔某仝心，烏塗mā ē變黃金。」</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">有時tsūn聽著厝邊翁仔某teh冤家，iah是阮兜teh大細聲，lóng ē緊去聽tsit塊歌，想著以前結婚時ê甜蜜，tsit-má suah為著小可代誌吵鬧，實在真m̄值。俗語講：「家和萬事興，家亂萬世窮。」家庭和諧氣氛好，人就ē快活。翁仔某恩愛，囡仔乖巧，規家伙lóng快樂。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">聽歌mā ē-tàng鼓勵人有好ê生活態度，培養音樂基礎，hōo人情緒穩定，拄著翁仔某teh冤家ê時tsūn，ē想著一切lóng是「愛」。有一擺阿爸去果子園挽果子，無張持去挵著蜂siū，tsiok濟蜂出來叮阿爸，阿爸死死昏昏，阿母tsiok tio̍h急，tshuā阿爸tī病院蹛三工，suà--落-來阿母逐工lóng煮好料，kuānn去病院hōo阿爸食，路尾阿爸出院，阮規家伙lóng真歡喜。阿母kah阿爸ê感情tsiânn好，hōo人真欣羨！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">見若我聽著tsit塊歌〈針線情〉，lóng ē siàu念阿爸kah阿母，mā ē想著翁仔某有sio仝ê興趣，lóng ē唱歌、聽歌，為著家庭，做伙拍拚，創造美好ê生活。&nbsp;</span></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg23uAMJDXoztGr-rhDzJ01lrkehFKu9PfEi7uym2tR58rO6LXyaoEWw6teqccZgqAI6h_e9JrdFrU8M7RHGksyjRV32qqxI7FJ7_sqBmxZCnMFtHNzEdT5XdA4lCOu1AndFLeSsxP3oMwNRLr8ZkZoEfZUhu5N7WSFbAuhoG3xwRNe-4KYK_GP7l523TMT/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1369%E6%9C%9F_35.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg23uAMJDXoztGr-rhDzJ01lrkehFKu9PfEi7uym2tR58rO6LXyaoEWw6teqccZgqAI6h_e9JrdFrU8M7RHGksyjRV32qqxI7FJ7_sqBmxZCnMFtHNzEdT5XdA4lCOu1AndFLeSsxP3oMwNRLr8ZkZoEfZUhu5N7WSFbAuhoG3xwRNe-4KYK_GP7l523TMT/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1369%E6%9C%9F_35.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><!--more--><p></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg5nvVxXNbsB16fakDS9BHZV92LSv5LpwZpFvjNgl7lHlcI0Ic2ESoJgJp45Fa0jt7T5-OfXIwMAzUdN6kepsdb2U1PnGCfE-LA9S0lP-4MWZhe89bXSuZQx3ijA8ncIFram-Q-9GJdDHHpqLXyPyTg3va1enY-2NVx4aOm7r3KmrMa0MeP2rN1uS0ByYX-/s1424/369%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEg5nvVxXNbsB16fakDS9BHZV92LSv5LpwZpFvjNgl7lHlcI0Ic2ESoJgJp45Fa0jt7T5-OfXIwMAzUdN6kepsdb2U1PnGCfE-LA9S0lP-4MWZhe89bXSuZQx3ijA8ncIFram-Q-9GJdDHHpqLXyPyTg3va1enY-2NVx4aOm7r3KmrMa0MeP2rN1uS0ByYX-/w450-h640/369%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><div class=\"separator\" styl